  "question": {
    "text": "An elemental crystal has a density of <math><mn>8570</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math>. The packing efficiency is 0.68. The closest distance of approach between neighbouring atom is <math><mn>2.86</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Å</mi></math>. What is the mass in amu of one atom approximately?<br />\r[Report your answer by rounding it upto nearset whole number]"
  },
